    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Biogeography-Based Optimization (BBO)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/BrainStormOptimization",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear",
    "@value" : "2011"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-21515-5_36"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/HumanSocioInspired"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Human-inspired optimization where ideas are clustered and recombined/mutated to generate new candidate solutions. Reference: Shi, Y. (2011). Brain storm optimization algorithm. In Y. Tan, Y. Shi, Y. Chai, & G. Wang (Eds.), Advances in Swarm Intelligence (ICSI 2011) (LNCS 6728, pp. 303–309). Springer. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-21515-5_36"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Brain Storm Optimization (BSO)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/CMAES",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear",
    "@value" : "2001"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://doi.org/10.1162/106365601750190398"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/EvolutionaryComputation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Evolution strategy that adapts a multivariate normal search distribution by updating its covariance matrix. Reference: Hansen, N., & Ostermeier, A. (2001). Completely derandomized self-adaptation in evolution strategies. Evolutionary Computation, 9(2), 159–195. https://doi.org/10.1162/106365601750190398"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://dbpedia.org/resource/CMA-ES"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "CMA-ES (Covariance Matrix Adaptation Evolution Strategy)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/CentralForceOptimization",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear",
    "@value" : "2007"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/PhysicsInspired"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Deterministic metaheuristic based on gravitational kinematics where probes accelerate toward better regions under a central force model. Reference: Formato, R. A. (2007). Central force optimization: A new deterministic gradient-like optimization metaheuristic. OPSEARCH, 44, 1–33."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Central Force Optimization (CFO)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/ChargedSystemSearch",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear",
    "@value" : "2010"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00707-009-0270-4"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/PhysicsInspired"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Physics-inspired multi-agent approach combining Coulomb’s law and Newtonian mechanics, where charged particles move under attraction/repulsion. Reference: Kaveh, A., & Talatahari, S. (2010). A novel heuristic optimization method: Charged system search. Acta Mechanica, 213, 267–289. https://doi.org/10.1007/s00707-009-0270-4"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Charged System Search (CSS)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/ChemicalReactionOptimization",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear",
    "@value" : "2010"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://doi.org/10.1109/CEC.2010.5586351"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/PhysicsInspired"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Metaheuristic inspired by chemical reactions where molecules undergo collisions and transformations to minimize system energy. Reference: Lam, A. Y. S., & Li, V. O. K. (2010). Chemical-reaction-inspired metaheuristic for optimization. In 2010 IEEE Congress on Evolutionary Computation (CEC) (pp. 1–8). IEEE. https://doi.org/10.1109/CEC.2010.5586351"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Chemical Reaction Optimization (CRO)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/ClonalSelectionAlgorithm",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear",
    "@value" : "2002"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://doi.org/10.1109/TEVC.2002.1011539"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/BioInspired"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Artificial immune system algorithm using clonal selection, hypermutation, and selection to optimize or learn. Reference: de Castro, L. N., & von Zuben, F. J. (2002). Learning and optimization using the clonal selection principle. IEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation, 6(3), 239–251. https://doi.org/10.1109/TEVC.2002.1011539"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Clonal Selection Algorithm (CLONALG)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/mexo/ComputationalBudget",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
