    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Strength Pareto Evolutionary Algorithm 2: multi-objective EA with fitness assignment based on strength and density and an external archive. Reference: Zitzler, E., Laumanns, M., & Thiele, L. (2001). SPEA2: Improving the strength Pareto evolutionary algorithm. Technical Report 103, Computer Engineering and Networks Laboratory (TIK), ETH Zürich."
