    "@value" : "Swarm algorithm modeled on salp chain movement where a leader and followers update positions toward a food source. Reference: Mirjalili, S., Gandomi, A. H., Mirjalili, S. Z., Saremi, S., Faris, H., & Mirjalili, S. M. (2017). Salp swarm algorithm: A bio-inspired optimizer for engineering design problems. Advances in Engineering Software, 114, 163–191. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.advengsoft.2017.07.002"
