    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Neighborhood-based search that uses adaptive memory (tabu lists) to avoid cycling and guide exploration. Reference: Glover, F. (1989). Tabu Search—Part I. ORSA Journal on Computing, 1(3), 190–206. https://doi.org/10.1287/ijoc.1.3.190"
  } ],
