    "@value" : "Framework that systematically changes neighborhood structures to escape local optima and intensify search. Reference: Mladenović, N., & Hansen, P. (1997). Variable neighborhood search. Computers & Operations Research, 24, 1097–1100. https://doi.org/10.1016/S0305-0548(97)00031-2"
  } ],
