    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Population-based algorithm inspired by humpback whales' bubble-net hunting, combining encircling and spiral updating mechanisms. Reference: Mirjalili, S., & Lewis, A. (2016). The whale optimization algorithm. Advances in Engineering Software, 95, 51–67. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.advengsoft.2016.01.008"
  } ],
